    "<p><strong>한국체육산업개발, 독서경영 우수직장 인증</strong><br></p>\n<p> '독서경영 우수직장 인증제'는 문화체육관광부와 서울경제신문사가 주최하고</p>\n<p>한국출판문화산업진흥원과 국가브랜드진흥원이 주관하는 행사로, 다양한 독서경영 성과를 창출하고</p>\n<p>독서문화 확산에 기여하고 있는 기관을 선정해 우수 직장 인증 및 시상을 하는 제도다.</p>": 1,
    "<p><strong style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">한국체육산업개발, 가족친화기관 인증</span></span></strong><br></p>\n<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2.4pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: -2.4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">한국체육산업개발이 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">년 최초 인증 후 재인증을 취득</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 2022</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">년까지 가족친화기관 인증을 받았다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2.4pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: -2.4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">가족친화인증이란 가족친화제도를 모범적으로 운영하는 기업 및 공공기관에 대하여 심사를 통해 인증을 부여하는 제도를 말한다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2.4pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: -2.4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">기업에는 이직률 감소와 근로자 사기 증가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">생산성 증가를 근로자에게는 삶의 질 향상</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">직무만족도 증가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2.4pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: -2.4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">스트레스 감소를 </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">사회에는 </span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">저출산과 고령화 해소에 따른 국가경쟁력 강화라는 긍정적 효과를 가지고 있다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -2.4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">한국체육산업개발은 앞으로도 자녀출산 및 양육지원</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">유연근무제도</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">가족친화직장문화 조성 등 </span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 2.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -2.4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">가족친화제도를 더욱 효율적으로 운영</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">가족친화경영을 이어갈 계획이다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></span></span></p>": 1,
    "<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"> </span> </span> </span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #0000ff; letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">한국체육산업개발</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">㈜</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\"> \"</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\">2017</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">년 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">블라인드 채용 우수기관 경진대회</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\">”</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">고용노동부장관상 수상</span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\"><!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">한국체육산업개발</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">㈜</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">이 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\">2017</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">년 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\">“</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">편견없는 채용</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">·</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">블라인드 채용 우수기관 경진대회</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\">”</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">에서 우수기관에 선정</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">고용노동부장관상을 수상했다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">한국체육산업개발은 정부정책에 부응하여</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">기타공공기관 중 선도적으로 </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\">‘</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">블라인드 채용</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\">’</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">을 전면 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">확대하고</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 2016</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">년에 이어 지난해 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">하반기 신규직원 채용에서도 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">입사지원서에 </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">△</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">어학점수 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">△</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">사진 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">△</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">학력 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">△</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">나이</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">△</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">가족관계 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">△</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">신체조건</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">등 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">선입견과 편견을 가질 수 있는 모든 요인을 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">배제하고 </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">직무 관련 교육사항과 자격사항</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">경력 등 업무와 관련된 핵심사항만 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴돋움;\">기재하도록 했다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴돋움;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</span></span></span></span>": 1,
    "<p> </p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 굴림;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">한국체육산업개발, 가족친화기관 인증</span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.4pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -2.4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕;\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">한국체육산업개발이 </span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">년 최초 인증 후 재인증을 취득</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 2019</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">년까지 가족친화기관 인증을 받았다</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.4pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -2.4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">가족친화인증이란 가족친화제도를 모범적으로 운영하는 기업 및 공공기관에 대하여 심사를 통해 인증을 부여하는 제도를 말한다</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.4pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -2.4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">기업에는 이직률 감소와 근로자 사기 증가</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">생산성 증가를 근로자에게는 삶의 질 향상</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">직무만족도 증가</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.4pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -2.4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">스트레스 감소를 </span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">사회에는 </span></span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">저출산과 고령화 해소에 따른 국가경쟁력 강화라는 긍정적 효과를 가지고 있다</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.4pt; text-indent: -2.4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">한국체육산업개발은 앞으로도 자녀출산 및 양육지원</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">유연근무제도</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">가족친화직장문화 조성 등 </span></span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.4pt; text-indent: -2.4pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">가족친화제도를 더욱 효율적으로 운영</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">가족친화경영을 이어갈 계획이다</span><span style=\"font-family: 맑은 고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></span></span></p>": 1,
    "<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">-2016.06 문화체육관광부 산하 기타공공기관 대상 경영평가 최우수기관 선정</span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">한국체육산업개발</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">주</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">은 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년도에 이어서 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">2015</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년도 문화체육관광부 산하 </span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\">기타공공기관 및 단체 </span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">경영실적 평가에서 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년 연속 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">A</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">등급을 달성했다</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">또한 평가 순위는 총 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">35</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개 기관 중 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">1</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">위를 차지하였다</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.8;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">년 연속 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">A</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">등급을 달성한 한국체육산업개발</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">주</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">은 전체 </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">35</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">개 기관 중 모든 지표에서 골고루 최상위 성적을 보였다</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></span></p>": 1,
    "<p><br></p>": 1,
    "<p>한국체육산업개발(주)는 올림픽공원 공연 및 사진 , 스포츠센터 운영 정보 등 다양한 공공데이터를 적극 개방하고 표준화된 데이터 관리 체계를&nbsp;</p><p>통해 공공데이터 품질을 향상시켜 온 성과를 인정받아 문화공공데이터 개방 우수기관 평가에서 \"우수상\"을 수상하였습니다.</p>": 1,
    "한국체육산업개발(주)는 송파구 체육발전에 이바지한 공을 인정받아 2024년도 최우수 유관단체로 선정되었습니다.": 1,
    "한국체육산업개발(주)는 제2회 한국공공브랜드 대상에서 공공기관 혁신리더십 분야에서 최우수상을 수상하였습니다.": 1
